	       &lt;/p&gt;
	       
	   </Details></BugPattern><BugPattern abbrev='FCBL' category='CORRECTNESS' type='FCBL_FIELD_COULD_BE_LOCAL'><ShortDescription>Class defines fields that are used only as locals</ShortDescription><Details>
			
